5,1,1,talk,Mio,,We really need to figure out a way to split these bills that doesn't make us all stressed!,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,I agree. We should look at the actual costs over a full year before deciding on a new system.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Rin,,I just hope the new way isn't a total pain to manage every month.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,The current system is outdated. We need to see if the current split is actually fair for everyone.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Misaki,,I'm more concerned about how the payment process affects our mood in the house.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mio,,I'll check the sunlight and heating needs for the rooms and that kitchen notice about the cooler.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,I'll look into the last twelve utility statements and the electrician's quote for the rooms.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Rin,,I'm going to check the monthly settle at another house and the trial run of a reconciliation template.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,I'll investigate the plug-in monitor readings room by room and the payment log for the last twelve months.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Misaki,,I'll look at the settling up when the last rooms filled and the payment log as well.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
