30,2,1,talk,Mio,,"It's crazy that some rooms get no sun and need heat way earlier. Also, people are actually avoiding the cooler!","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,"The bills swing wildly between summer and winter. Also, installing individual meters would be quite expensive per room.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,1,talk,Rin,,"Managing meters at another house takes forever, and that reconciliation template was a nightmare to fill out.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Some of us use four times more power than others. Plus, payments are often late because people keep questioning the amounts.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,1,talk,Misaki,,"It took weeks to settle the newcomers' shares, and the payment log shows a lot of friction and delays.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Ryuji, if the bills swing that much, no wonder we're all stressed in February!","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"Exactly. And since the electrician's quote is so high, a hardware fix might not be the most rational move.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Shunichi, if people are already questioning the amounts, a complex template will only make it worse.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Mio, the monitor readings prove that a flat split is unfair when usage varies that much.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Rin, I agree. The administrative side is clearly damaging our relationships.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,3,talk,Mio,,I don't want us to be afraid of using the heater or the cooler just to save money.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,We need a system that handles the seasonal spikes without causing a financial shock.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,3,talk,Rin,,"Whatever we do, it can't be a forty-minute chore every single month.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,We can't ignore the fact that some people are effectively subsidizing others' electricity.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,3,talk,Misaki,,We need a method that minimizes the need for constant reminders and arguments.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
